# =============================================================================
#  custom-domains.list - your own domains
# =============================================================================
#  One domain per line. Everything listed here is routed through the
#  "⭐ Custom" proxy group, and that rule sits ABOVE the ad list and ABOVE the
#  RKN list - an explicit decision of yours always wins.
#
#  Bare domains are enough: the build script adds the "+." prefix
#  (DOMAIN-SUFFIX), so "example.com" also covers "www.example.com".
#  Hyphens are fine too: "my-site.ru" is a valid entry.
#
#  Lines starting with "#" and empty lines are ignored.
#
#  Rebuild the rule-set after editing:
#      ./scripts/build-ruleset.sh
# =============================================================================

# --- examples, replace or delete them ---
# my-site.ru
# my-cdn.example.com
